@startuml F0.6-a-protocolo-encontrado
title F0.6-a — Verificar protocolo (encontrado)
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Verificador" as Verificador
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "ProtocoloController" as Ctrl
participant "VerificarProtocoloUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Verificador -> WebApp: /publico/verificar-protocolo/:id
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET (público, sem JWT)
note right of Ctrl
  RateLimitFilter só por IP
  RN-F0.6-01
end note
Ctrl -> UC: execute(id)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT protocolo
Postgres --> UC: protocolo

note right of UC
  Mascarar solicitanteNomeParcial
  Nunca GRR — RN-F0.6-02 / LGPD
end note

UC --> Ctrl: metadados + hashSha256
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 OK
WebApp --> Verificador: card + zona upload opcional

@enduml
